@ReferenceArchitecture.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5292

GET {{ReferenceArchitecture.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

@host = http://localhost:5292

### Get all notes
GET {{host}}/api/notes
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a note
POST {{host}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "First note",
  "body": "Hello from the API"
}

###

### Get a specific note
GET {{host}}/api/notes/1
Accept: application/json

